      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe pa Nehemia ma wod Hakalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie etimbre i dwi Kislev, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kislev = dwi mir abung’wende mi Juyahudi, dwi apar acende ku mir arionde mi oro mwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " i rundi pier arionde, nwang’u ani i Cucan ma odker, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nia Hanani, ma ng’atu acel ma kind juwada, ubino, giku jumange m’uai i Yuda; man apenjogi pi Juyahudi m’uboth, m’udong’ mi ng’eca, man pi Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwacu ira kumae, Dong’ dhanu m’udong’ mi ng’eca kuca i ng’etker gini i masendi ma dit man cac: gang’kidi mi Yerusalem bende jurwombo piny, man dhugang’ne de juwang’u ku mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde m’awinjo lembe maeni, nia abedo piny man aywak, e can unega nindo moko; man aweko cam arwo de i wang’ Mungu m’i polo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man awacu kumae, Akwei, E Yehova, Mungu m’i polo, Mungu ma dwong’ ma jang’oi ndiri, ma gwoko lembariba man mer mi bero ku ju m’umare m’uworo lembariba pare: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kawono wek ithi bed acika, weng’i de ayaba, kara iwinj rwo pa jatic peri, m’arwo i weng’i i nindo maeni, dieceng’ ku diewor, pi nyithindho mir Israel ma jutic peri, kinde m’atuco dubo mi nyithindho mir Israel, ma wadubo iri. Eyo, an ku ot pa vwa wadubo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "watimo rac dit i beng’i, man wawolo lembang’ola ngo, kadok cik de, kadi lembapoka, m’ing’olo ni jatic peri Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 26:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poi, akwei, pi lembe m’ing’olo ni jatic peri Musa, m’iwacu kumae, Tek wukier, abilaluwu mba mba i kind kodhidhanu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.30.1+DEU.30.2+DEU.30.3+DEU.30.4+DEU.30.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 30:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento tek wudwogo i bang’a, man wuworo lembang’ola para wutimogi de, kadok dhanu mu ma juriemo gini i kajik mi ng’et polo, ento abicokogi ku kuca, man abikelogi i ka m’afoyo, kara aketh nyinga bed keca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie joni gi jutic peri man dhanu peri, m’iwaru ku tego peri ma dit, man ku cingi ma tek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Rwoth, akwei, kawono wek ithi bed acika ni rwo pa jatic peri, man ni rwo mi jutic peri, ma anyong’a migi en e lworo nyingi; akwei, keth lembe bed miero ni jatic peri tin, man imi ire kisa i wang’ ng’atu maeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Nwang’u an a jating’ kikombe p’ubimo.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
